<title>USA: NYS Urban Development Corp $174 mln repriced.</title>
<headline>NYS Urban Development Corp $174 mln repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc on Tuesday said it repriced a $174 million New York State Urban Development Corporation Empire State Development Corporation capital facilities revenue bond, Series 7, issue, cutting the yield in 2027 to 5.90 percent from 5.925 percent.</p>
